From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yuri Timenkov <yuri@timenkov.pro>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 11:18:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] net: pcs: mtk_lynxi: support fwnode_pcs as module

When CONFIG_FWNODE_PCS set to M define becomes CONFIG_FWNODE_PCS_MODULE
and condition incorrectly excludes the driver registration

(cherry picked from commit a638fabe36f293e58ab6be002af04b866959c546)
---
 drivers/net/pcs/pcs-mtk-lynxi.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/pcs/pcs-mtk-lynxi.c b/drivers/net/pcs/pcs-mtk-lynxi.c
index 85d843f3c5b50..7f788ea0fa82b 100644
--- a/drivers/net/pcs/pcs-mtk-lynxi.c
+++ b/drivers/net/pcs/pcs-mtk-lynxi.c
@@ -411,7 +411,7 @@ void mtk_pcs_lynxi_destroy(struct phylink_pcs *pcs)
 }
 EXPORT_SYMBOL(mtk_pcs_lynxi_destroy);
 
-#ifdef CONFIG_FWNODE_PCS
+#if IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_FWNODE_PCS)
 static int mtk_pcs_lynxi_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 {
 	struct device *dev = &pdev->dev;
